.sp
.SH "SUGGESTED ALIASES"
.sp
Some common short\-hand aliases\&. Feel free to add these to your \fI~/\&.gitconfig\fR file\&.
.sp
.if n \{\
.RS 4
.\}
.nf
[alias]
  squash = squash\-branch
.fi
.if n \{\
.RE
.\}
.sp
